# Root safety-net ignores (applies across web/ and mobile/)

# dependencies
**/node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.*

# env / secrets — never commit
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# build output
**/.next/
**/out/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.expo/

# logs & debug
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem
*.tsbuildinfo
.vercel
